nt x="52" y="1065"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value="Thick arrows ①–⑪ = one iteration of the research loop; ⑪ closes it. Two-headed arrows = request and reply on the same channel. Thin arrows = side paths. Thick rounded border = the added state-driven loop.&lt;br&gt;Frames = OS processes. Processes 1 and 3 never talk directly: they share code (overlap) and files on disk. Dashed = outside this repo." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1118" width="1980" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>